# Commercial assets

## Folders
- Root: design & print (menus, posters, reports)
- Music Photography (Commercial)/ — live music shoots (tag: music-photography)
- Photography Commercial/ — events, portraits, festivals (tag: photography)
  - Costume/ — also tagged costume

## Adding photos
1. Drop files in the right folder.
2. Add the filename to src/data/commercialManifests.ts
3. New filter types: add id in commercialTags.ts and tags[] on each work.
